TYPES.md §7.3, EVALUATION.md §6.2: a finite binary64 result stored into a Float32 that overflows
binary32 is E3202 (the product is finite, so no E4104); the largest Float32 fits.
-- teamboard/tuning.canon --
package teamboard

const big = 1e38

record Tuning {
  scale: Float32
  base: Float32
}

let tuning: Tuning = { scale: big * 10.0, base: 3.4028234e38 }
-- findings.txt --
error[E3202]  teamboard/tuning.canon:10:31
  tuning.scale: 1e+39 overflows Float32

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
